   "widgets_values": [
    "Write the brief. Shot Planner returns a shot list (JSON) plus one image prompt and one video prompt per shot. provider = offline needs no key (template-based); gemini, anthropic or openai write better shots.\nAPI keys: set them as environment variables before starting ComfyUI, never in the workflow. GEMINI_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY), ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "Note: 1 · Brief to shot list"
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "type": "Note",
   "pos": [
